    <div class="suspended-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#c0392b" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h2>Account Under Investigation</h2>
    <p>Your account has been placed under a security review due to suspicious activity. All of your listings have been hidden from buyers and you will not be able to post new listings while this review is in progress.</p>
    <p class="emphasis">Please do not email us about this — the review will be completed soon and the outcome will be sent to your account.</p>
    <button class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" style="width:100%;justify-content:center" onclick="doSignOut()">Sign out</button>
    <div class="suspended-footer">Nyumba254 · Account Security</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="admin-blocked-screen">
  <div class="suspended-card">
    <div class="suspended-icon" style="background:var(--green-light)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21v-1a8 8 0 0116 0v1"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h2>This is an admin account</h2>
    <p>Admin accounts can't post or manage listings as a seller — this dashboard is for sellers only.</p>
    <p class="emphasis">Admin accounts sign in separately and aren't accessible from this login.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:6px">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;text-decoration:none">Browse listings</a>
    </div>
    <div class="suspended-footer">Nyumba254 · Account Roles · <span onclick="doSignOut()" style="text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer">Sign out instead</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="buyer-blocked-screen">
  <div class="suspended-card">
    <div class="suspended-icon" style="background:var(--green-light)">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 00-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 000-7.78z"/></svg>
